# Testing Governance

**Reference:** `testing-strategy.md`, Constitution §50

## Minimum by Change Type

| Change | Tests |
|--------|-------|
| Domain rule | Unit |
| Handler | Unit (mocked ports) |
| HTTP endpoint | Feature + authorization |
| Security surface | Security feature tests |
| Cross-tenant | Cross-school / IDOR tests |

## Not Done Until

Tests pass + `architecture:validate` + `security:validate` (when security touched).

Visual-only "works" is not complete.

## Enrollment/Student Pattern

Mirror existing: `tests/Feature/Security/*`, policy denial, mass assignment, audit persistence.
